AUTHDS   DSECT                     USED FOR RETURN FROM SUBS(R10)       00109500
AUTHGOOD DS    F'0'                                                     00109600
AUTHWARN DS    F'0'                                                     00109700
AUTHFAIL DS    F'0'                                                     00109800
